{title: His Eye is on the Sparrow}
{artist: Newsboys Version}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Why should I feel discouraged,
[C]Why should the shadows [Cm]come,    [D/F#]
[Bm]Why should my heart be [Bm7]lonely,   [C]
And long [Am]for heav'n [D]and home,   [G]
